# macOS AppleDouble and editor droppings. `._*` in particular: these get created
# whenever a folder is copied on macOS, and an `._`-adjacent "name 2.md"
# duplicate was committed into templates/ once, which start.sh then offered to
# every new project as a project template.
**/._*
*~
